Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:07.36,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur12\3c&HDCCB78&\t(0,1000,\3c&HAB9750&)}如{\fnTO319QGB}果 {\fnC91EDMVV}如{\fnTO319QGB}果 {\fnC91EDMVV}如{\fnTO319QGB}果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur12\3c&HAB9750&\t(1500,3000,\3c&HDCCB78&)\fnTO319QGB}如果{\fnC91EDMVV}今後還能{\fnTO319QGB}再見
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.36,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur12\3c&HDCCB78&\t(0,2000,\3c&HAB9750&)\fnTO319QGB}從此往後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:18.37,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur12\3c&HAB9750&\t(0,3000,\3c&HDCCB78&)}每一瞬每一寸的{\fnTO319QGB}點點滴滴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:21.79,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur12\3c&HDCCB78&\t(0,2000,\3c&HAB9750&)}我全都會牢牢{\fnTO319QGB}記住
